WEBVTT

00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:01.268
It's social, it's interactive,

00:02:01.292 --> 00:02:02.583
it's conversational.

00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:05.601
Over the last two decades,

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:10.309
I have been researching consumers
in emerging markets around the world,

00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:14.393
digging beneath the surface
to truly understand who they are,

00:02:14.417 --> 00:02:15.684
how they live

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:17.917
and what they want when they go shopping.

00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:22.309
Shopping, like everything else,
has moved online.

00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:24.351
Shopping online is great.

00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:26.476
It's convenient --
at the click of a button,

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.393
delivered to your doorstep.

00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:29.684
It has everything.

00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:31.518
It has great prices.